---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator invokes publishSaleResults(claimRoot, acceptedRoot, totalTokens, decimals, raisedCapital)
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_active: sale has not ended
    q_revert_active --> [*]: revert SaleStillActive
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: sale ended
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period not complete
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_refund --> q_check_published: refund period complete
    q_check_published --> q_revert_dup: results already published
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadyPublished
    q_check_published --> q_set: results not yet published
    q_set --> [*]: set Merkle roots, totalTokensAllocated, totalCapitalRaised; emit SaleResultsPublished()

    note right of q_set
        INV-001: publishRaisedCapital sets the raised capital before results
        INV-002: Accepted allocations may be less than deposited amounts
        INV-003: Excess capital claimable via withdrawExcessInvestedCapital with Merkle proof
    end note
